Bounded projection of the Hermes Agent CLI focused on the common
session lifecycle: start or continue a chat, pick the model, and
resume a previous session. ycode renders and validates this contract;
the chat/model/resume lifecycle runs only when main.bpp forwards it to
the installed upstream, so under ycode itself it exits unsupported (4).


Usage:
  hermes [OPTIONS] [PROMPT] [command]

Available Commands:
  chat        Start or continue an interactive or one-shot chat session
  completion  Generate a shell completion script for the declared command tree
  help        Show help for a declared command
  model       Select the default model and provider
  schema      Print the profile JSON Schema
  validate    Validate and compile this CLI profile
  version     Print version information

Flags:
  -f, --file string        Strict harness configuration (default "agent.yaml")
  -h, --help               Show command help
  -m, --model string       Model override for this invocation (e.g. anthropic/claude-sonnet-4.6)
      --provider string    Provider override for this invocation (e.g. openrouter, anthropic)
      --reasoning string   Reasoning effort: none, minimal, low, medium, high, xhigh, max, ultra
  -r, --resume string      Resume a previous session by id or title, or 'latest'
      --tui                Launch the modern TUI instead of the classic REPL
      --yolo               Bypass dangerous-command approval prompts


